{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 22,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 676.756,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 4.458,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, as Ammon was thus teaching the people of Lamoni continually,",
      "verse": "22:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 4.638,
      "end": 8.214,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we will return to the account of Aaron and his brethren;",
      "verse": "22:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 8.394,
      "end": 11.459,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for after he departed from the land of Middoni",
      "verse": "22:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 11.639,
      "end": 14.843,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he was led by the Spirit to the land of Nephi,",
      "verse": "22:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 15.023,
      "end": 18.599,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even to the house of the king which was over all the land",
      "verse": "22:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 18.779,
      "end": 21.101,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "save it were the land of Ishmael;",
      "verse": "22:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 21.281,
      "end": 23.696,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he was the father of Lamoni.",
      "verse": "22:1",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 24.376,
      "end": 29.392,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he went in unto him into the king's palace, with his brethren,",
      "verse": "22:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 29.572,
      "end": 31.708,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and bowed himself before the king,",
      "verse": "22:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 31.888,
      "end": 33.467,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and said unto him:",
      "verse": "22:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 33.647,
      "end": 36.851,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, O king, we are the brethren of Ammon,",
      "verse": "22:2",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 37.031,
      "end": 39.353,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whom thou hast delivered out of prison.",
      "verse": "22:2",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 40.033,
      "end": 44.77,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, O king, if thou wilt spare our lives, we will be thy servants.",
      "verse": "22:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 44.95,
      "end": 46.808,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the king said unto them:",
      "verse": "22:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 46.988,
      "end": 49.774,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Arise, for I will grant unto you your lives,",
      "verse": "22:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 49.954,
      "end": 53.019,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will not suffer that ye shall be my servants;",
      "verse": "22:3",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 53.199,
      "end": 56.589,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but I will insist that ye shall administer unto me;",
      "verse": "22:3",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 56.769,
      "end": 66.382,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I have been somewhat troubled in mind because of the generosity and the greatness of the words of thy brother Ammon;",
      "verse": "22:3",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 66.562,
      "end": 70.974,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I desire to know the cause why he has not come up out of Middoni with thee.",
      "verse": "22:3",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 71.654,
      "end": 73.697,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Aaron said unto the king:",
      "verse": "22:4",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 73.877,
      "end": 76.896,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, the Spirit of the Lord has called him another way;",
      "verse": "22:4",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 77.076,
      "end": 81.256,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he has gone to the land of Ishmael, to teach the people of Lamoni.",
      "verse": "22:4",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 81.936,
      "end": 83.886,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the king said unto them:",
      "verse": "22:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 84.066,
      "end": 87.595,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "What is this that ye have said concerning the Spirit of the Lord?",
      "verse": "22:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 87.775,
      "end": 90.376,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, this is the thing which doth trouble me.",
      "verse": "22:5",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 91.056,
      "end": 93.471,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And also, what is this that Ammon said\u2014",
      "verse": "22:6",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 93.651,
      "end": 95.88,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "If ye will repent ye shall be saved,",
      "verse": "22:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 96.06,
      "end": 99.682,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and if ye will not repent, ye shall be cast off at the last day?",
      "verse": "22:6",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 100.362,
      "end": 102.823,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Aaron answered him and said unto him:",
      "verse": "22:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 103.003,
      "end": 105.139,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Believest thou that there is a God?",
      "verse": "22:7",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 105.319,
      "end": 106.759,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the king said:",
      "verse": "22:7",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 106.939,
      "end": 110.376,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I know that the Amalekites say that there is a God,",
      "verse": "22:7",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 110.556,
      "end": 113.946,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I have granted unto them that they should build sanctuaries,",
      "verse": "22:7",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 114.126,
      "end": 117.702,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they may assemble themselves together to worship him.",
      "verse": "22:7",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 117.882,
      "end": 121.597,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And if now thou sayest there is a God, behold I will believe.",
      "verse": "22:7",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 122.277,
      "end": 126.317,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now when Aaron heard this, his heart began to rejoice,",
      "verse": "22:8",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 126.497,
      "end": 127.797,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he said:",
      "verse": "22:8",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 127.977,
      "end": 131.553,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, assuredly as thou livest, O king, there is a God.",
      "verse": "22:8",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 132.233,
      "end": 133.673,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the king said:",
      "verse": "22:9",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 133.853,
      "end": 138.451,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Is God that Great Spirit that brought our fathers out of the land of Jerusalem?",
      "verse": "22:9",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 139.131,
      "end": 140.896,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Aaron said unto him:",
      "verse": "22:10",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 141.076,
      "end": 143.026,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, he is that Great Spirit,",
      "verse": "22:10",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 143.206,
      "end": 146.41,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he created all things both in heaven and in earth.",
      "verse": "22:10",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 146.59,
      "end": 148.262,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Believest thou this?",
      "verse": "22:10",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 148.942,
      "end": 150.242,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said:",
      "verse": "22:11",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 150.422,
      "end": 153.673,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, I believe that the Great Spirit created all things,",
      "verse": "22:11",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 153.853,
      "end": 157.568,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I desire that ye should tell me concerning all these things,",
      "verse": "22:11",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 157.748,
      "end": 159.606,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will believe thy words.",
      "verse": "22:11",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 160.286,
      "end": 167.438,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when Aaron saw that the king would believe his words, he began from the creation of Adam,",
      "verse": "22:12",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 167.618,
      "end": 169.847,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "reading the scriptures unto the king\u2014",
      "verse": "22:12",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 170.027,
      "end": 172.86,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "how God created man after his own image,",
      "verse": "22:12",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 173.04,
      "end": 175.269,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that God gave him commandments,",
      "verse": "22:12",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 175.449,
      "end": 178.7,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that because of transgression, man had fallen.",
      "verse": "22:12",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 179.38,
      "end": 184.21,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Aaron did expound unto him the scriptures from the creation of Adam,",
      "verse": "22:13",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 184.39,
      "end": 186.758,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "laying the fall of man before him,",
      "verse": "22:13",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 186.938,
      "end": 190.607,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their carnal state, and also the plan of redemption,",
      "verse": "22:13",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 190.787,
      "end": 197.753,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was prepared from the foundation of the world, through Christ, for all whosoever would believe on his name.",
      "verse": "22:13",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 198.433,
      "end": 202.891,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And since man had fallen he could not merit anything of himself;",
      "verse": "22:14",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 203.071,
      "end": 209.944,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but the sufferings and death of Christ atone for their sins, through faith and repentance, and so forth;",
      "verse": "22:14",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 210.124,
      "end": 212.539,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that he breaketh the bands of death,",
      "verse": "22:14",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 212.719,
      "end": 215.18,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the grave shall have no victory,",
      "verse": "22:14",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 215.36,
      "end": 220.515,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that the sting of death should be swallowed up in the hopes of glory;",
      "verse": "22:14",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 220.695,
      "end": 224.085,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and Aaron did expound all these things unto the king.",
      "verse": "22:14",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 224.765,
      "end": 229.409,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that after Aaron had expounded these things unto him,",
      "verse": "22:15",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 229.589,
      "end": 231.075,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the king said:",
      "verse": "22:15",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 231.255,
      "end": 232.648,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "What shall I do",
      "verse": "22:15",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 232.828,
      "end": 236.311,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I may have this eternal life of which thou hast spoken?",
      "verse": "22:15",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 236.491,
      "end": 238.024,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, what shall I do",
      "verse": "22:15",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 238.204,
      "end": 243.312,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I may be born of God, having this wicked spirit rooted out of my breast,",
      "verse": "22:15",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 243.492,
      "end": 245.117,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and receive his Spirit,",
      "verse": "22:15",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 245.297,
      "end": 247.247,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I may be filled with joy,",
      "verse": "22:15",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 247.427,
      "end": 250.121,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I may not be cast off at the last day?",
      "verse": "22:15",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 250.301,
      "end": 251.787,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, said he,",
      "verse": "22:15",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 251.967,
      "end": 254.057,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will give up all that I possess,",
      "verse": "22:15",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 254.237,
      "end": 256.605,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, I will forsake my kingdom,",
      "verse": "22:15",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 256.785,
      "end": 258.875,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I may receive this great joy.",
      "verse": "22:15",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 259.555,
      "end": 261.32,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But Aaron said unto him:",
      "verse": "22:16",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 261.5,
      "end": 263.45,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "If thou desirest this thing,",
      "verse": "22:16",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 263.63,
      "end": 265.952,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if thou wilt bow down before God,",
      "verse": "22:16",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 266.132,
      "end": 268.872,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, if thou wilt repent of all thy sins,",
      "verse": "22:16",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 269.052,
      "end": 271.095,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and will bow down before God,",
      "verse": "22:16",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 271.275,
      "end": 273.225,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and call on his name in faith,",
      "verse": "22:16",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 273.405,
      "end": 275.588,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "believing that ye shall receive,",
      "verse": "22:16",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 275.768,
      "end": 278.787,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "then shalt thou receive the hope which thou desirest.",
      "verse": "22:16",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 279.467,
      "end": 285.783,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when Aaron had said these words, the king did bow down before the Lord, upon his knees;",
      "verse": "22:17",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 285.963,
      "end": 289.307,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even he did prostrate himself upon the earth,",
      "verse": "22:17",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 289.487,
      "end": 291.53,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and cried mightily, saying:",
      "verse": "22:17",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 292.21,
      "end": 293.139,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O God,",
      "verse": "22:18",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 293.319,
      "end": 295.966,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Aaron hath told me that there is a God;",
      "verse": "22:18",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 296.146,
      "end": 298.979,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and if there is a God, and if thou art God,",
      "verse": "22:18",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 299.159,
      "end": 301.527,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wilt thou make thyself known unto me,",
      "verse": "22:18",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 301.707,
      "end": 304.679,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will give away all my sins to know thee,",
      "verse": "22:18",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 304.859,
      "end": 309.596,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that I may be raised from the dead, and be saved at the last day.",
      "verse": "22:18",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 309.776,
      "end": 313.677,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now when the king had said these words, he was struck as if he were dead.",
      "verse": "22:18",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 314.357,
      "end": 320.441,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that his servants ran and told the queen all that had happened unto the king.",
      "verse": "22:19",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 320.621,
      "end": 322.618,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And she came in unto the king;",
      "verse": "22:19",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 322.798,
      "end": 325.677,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and when she saw him lay as if he were dead,",
      "verse": "22:19",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 325.857,
      "end": 330.78,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also Aaron and his brethren standing as though they had been the cause of his fall,",
      "verse": "22:19",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 330.96,
      "end": 332.678,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "she was angry with them,",
      "verse": "22:19",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 332.858,
      "end": 336.805,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and commanded that her servants, or the servants of the king,",
      "verse": "22:19",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 336.985,
      "end": 339.307,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "should take them and slay them.",
      "verse": "22:19",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 339.987,
      "end": 343.47,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the servants had seen the cause of the king's fall,",
      "verse": "22:20",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 343.65,
      "end": 347.83,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they durst not lay their hands on Aaron and his brethren;",
      "verse": "22:20",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 348.01,
      "end": 350.332,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they pled with the queen saying:",
      "verse": "22:20",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 350.512,
      "end": 353.484,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Why commandest thou that we should slay these men,",
      "verse": "22:20",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 353.664,
      "end": 356.775,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when behold one of them is mightier than us all?",
      "verse": "22:20",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 356.955,
      "end": 359.138,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore we shall fall before them.",
      "verse": "22:20",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 359.818,
      "end": 363.022,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now when the queen saw the fear of the servants",
      "verse": "22:21",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 363.202,
      "end": 368.032,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "she also began to fear exceedingly, lest there should some evil come upon her.",
      "verse": "22:21",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 368.212,
      "end": 371.881,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And she commanded her servants that they should go and call the people,",
      "verse": "22:21",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 372.061,
      "end": 374.894,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might slay Aaron and his brethren.",
      "verse": "22:21",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 375.574,
      "end": 382.261,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now when Aaron saw the determination of the queen, he, also knowing the hardness of the hearts of the people,",
      "verse": "22:22",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 382.441,
      "end": 386.249,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "feared lest that a multitude should assemble themselves together,",
      "verse": "22:22",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 386.429,
      "end": 391.166,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there should be a great contention and a disturbance among them;",
      "verse": "22:22",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 391.346,
      "end": 393.343,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore he put forth his hand",
      "verse": "22:22",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 393.523,
      "end": 395.706,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and raised the king from the earth,",
      "verse": "22:22",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 395.886,
      "end": 397.465,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and said unto him:",
      "verse": "22:22",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 397.645,
      "end": 398.713,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Stand.",
      "verse": "22:22",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 398.893,
      "end": 402.144,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he stood upon his feet, receiving his strength.",
      "verse": "22:22",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 402.824,
      "end": 407.607,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now this was done in the presence of the queen and many of the servants.",
      "verse": "22:23",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 407.787,
      "end": 410.109,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And when they saw it they greatly marveled,",
      "verse": "22:23",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 410.289,
      "end": 411.961,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to fear.",
      "verse": "22:23",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 412.141,
      "end": 413.813,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the king stood forth,",
      "verse": "22:23",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 413.993,
      "end": 416.315,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to minister unto them.",
      "verse": "22:23",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 416.495,
      "end": 418.399,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he did minister unto them,",
      "verse": "22:23",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 418.579,
      "end": 422.155,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that his whole household were converted unto the Lord.",
      "verse": "22:23",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 422.835,
      "end": 427.293,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now there was a multitude gathered together because of the commandment of the queen,",
      "verse": "22:24",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 427.473,
      "end": 432.674,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there began to be great murmurings among them because of Aaron and his brethren.",
      "verse": "22:24",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 433.354,
      "end": 437.162,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But the king stood forth among them and administered unto them.",
      "verse": "22:25",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 437.342,
      "end": 441.289,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they were pacified towards Aaron and those who were with him.",
      "verse": "22:25",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 441.969,
      "end": 446.752,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when the king saw that the people were pacified,",
      "verse": "22:26",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 446.932,
      "end": 453.248,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he caused that Aaron and his brethren should stand forth in the midst of the multitude,",
      "verse": "22:26",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 453.428,
      "end": 456.539,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that they should preach the word unto them.",
      "verse": "22:26",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 457.219,
      "end": 462.792,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the king sent a proclamation throughout all the land,",
      "verse": "22:27",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 462.972,
      "end": 468.916,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "amongst all his people who were in all his land, who were in all the regions round about,",
      "verse": "22:27",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 469.096,
      "end": 473.508,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was bordering even to the sea, on the east and on the west,",
      "verse": "22:27",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 473.688,
      "end": 478.796,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and which was divided from the land of Zarahemla by a narrow strip of wilderness,",
      "verse": "22:27",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 478.976,
      "end": 482.505,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which ran from the sea east even to the sea west,",
      "verse": "22:27",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 482.685,
      "end": 485.704,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and round about on the borders of the seashore,",
      "verse": "22:27",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 485.884,
      "end": 488.81,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the borders of the wilderness",
      "verse": "22:27",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 488.99,
      "end": 500.228,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was on the north by the land of Zarahemla, through the borders of Manti, by the head of the river Sidon, running from the east towards the west\u2014",
      "verse": "22:27",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 500.408,
      "end": 504.03,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus were the Lamanites and the Nephites divided.",
      "verse": "22:27",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 504.71,
      "end": 507.218,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, the more idle part of the Lamanites",
      "verse": "22:28",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 507.398,
      "end": 510.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "lived in the wilderness, and dwelt in tents;",
      "verse": "22:28",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 510.597,
      "end": 515.055,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were spread through the wilderness on the west, in the land of Nephi;",
      "verse": "22:28",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 515.235,
      "end": 520.901,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and also on the west of the land of Zarahemla, in the borders by the seashore,",
      "verse": "22:28",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 521.081,
      "end": 526.561,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and on the west in the land of Nephi, in the place of their fathers' first inheritance,",
      "verse": "22:28",
      "lineIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "start": 526.741,
      "end": 529.342,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus bordering along by the seashore.",
      "verse": "22:28",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 530.022,
      "end": 533.969,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And also there were many Lamanites on the east by the seashore,",
      "verse": "22:29",
      "lineIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "start": 534.149,
      "end": 536.517,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whither the Nephites had driven them.",
      "verse": "22:29",
      "lineIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "start": 536.697,
      "end": 540.319,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus the Nephites were nearly surrounded by the Lamanites;",
      "verse": "22:29",
      "lineIndex": 155
    },
    {
      "start": 540.499,
      "end": 545.515,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless the Nephites had taken possession of all the northern parts of the land",
      "verse": "22:29",
      "lineIndex": 156
    },
    {
      "start": 545.695,
      "end": 556.562,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "bordering on the wilderness, at the head of the river Sidon, from the east to the west, round about on the wilderness side; on the north,",
      "verse": "22:29",
      "lineIndex": 157
    },
    {
      "start": 556.742,
      "end": 560.597,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even until they came to the land which they called Bountiful.",
      "verse": "22:29",
      "lineIndex": 158
    },
    {
      "start": 561.277,
      "end": 564.621,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it bordered upon the land which they called Desolation,",
      "verse": "22:30",
      "lineIndex": 159
    },
    {
      "start": 564.801,
      "end": 568.052,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it being so far northward that it came into the land",
      "verse": "22:30",
      "lineIndex": 160
    },
    {
      "start": 568.232,
      "end": 572.69,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which had been peopled and been destroyed, of whose bones we have spoken,",
      "verse": "22:30",
      "lineIndex": 161
    },
    {
      "start": 572.87,
      "end": 576.028,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which was discovered by the people of Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "22:30",
      "lineIndex": 162
    },
    {
      "start": 576.208,
      "end": 578.484,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it being the place of their first landing.",
      "verse": "22:30",
      "lineIndex": 163
    },
    {
      "start": 579.164,
      "end": 582.693,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they came from there up into the south wilderness.",
      "verse": "22:31",
      "lineIndex": 164
    },
    {
      "start": 582.873,
      "end": 586.263,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thus the land on the northward was called Desolation,",
      "verse": "22:31",
      "lineIndex": 165
    },
    {
      "start": 586.443,
      "end": 589.694,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the land on the southward was called Bountiful,",
      "verse": "22:31",
      "lineIndex": 166
    },
    {
      "start": 589.874,
      "end": 595.54,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it being the wilderness which is filled with all manner of wild animals of every kind,",
      "verse": "22:31",
      "lineIndex": 167
    },
    {
      "start": 595.72,
      "end": 599.11,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "a part of which had come from the land northward for food.",
      "verse": "22:31",
      "lineIndex": 168
    },
    {
      "start": 599.79,
      "end": 604.434,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, it was only the distance of a day and a half's journey for a Nephite,",
      "verse": "22:32",
      "lineIndex": 169
    },
    {
      "start": 604.614,
      "end": 610.373,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "on the line Bountiful and the land Desolation, from the east to the west sea;",
      "verse": "22:32",
      "lineIndex": 170
    },
    {
      "start": 610.553,
      "end": 616.451,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus the land of Nephi and the land of Zarahemla were nearly surrounded by water,",
      "verse": "22:32",
      "lineIndex": 171
    },
    {
      "start": 616.631,
      "end": 621.275,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there being a small neck of land between the land northward and the land southward.",
      "verse": "22:32",
      "lineIndex": 172
    },
    {
      "start": 621.955,
      "end": 627.574,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the Nephites had inhabited the land Bountiful,",
      "verse": "22:33",
      "lineIndex": 173
    },
    {
      "start": 627.754,
      "end": 630.262,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even from the east unto the west sea,",
      "verse": "22:33",
      "lineIndex": 174
    },
    {
      "start": 630.442,
      "end": 637.176,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus the Nephites in their wisdom, with their guards and their armies, had hemmed in the Lamanites on the south,",
      "verse": "22:33",
      "lineIndex": 175
    },
    {
      "start": 637.356,
      "end": 640.978,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that thereby they should have no more possession on the north,",
      "verse": "22:33",
      "lineIndex": 176
    },
    {
      "start": 641.158,
      "end": 644.873,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might not overrun the land northward.",
      "verse": "22:33",
      "lineIndex": 177
    },
    {
      "start": 645.553,
      "end": 648.85,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore the Lamanites could have no more possessions",
      "verse": "22:34",
      "lineIndex": 178
    },
    {
      "start": 649.03,
      "end": 652.374,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "only in the land of Nephi, and the wilderness round about.",
      "verse": "22:34",
      "lineIndex": 179
    },
    {
      "start": 652.554,
      "end": 657.244,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now this was wisdom in the Nephites\u2014as the Lamanites were an enemy to them,",
      "verse": "22:34",
      "lineIndex": 180
    },
    {
      "start": 657.424,
      "end": 660.907,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they would not suffer their afflictions on every hand,",
      "verse": "22:34",
      "lineIndex": 181
    },
    {
      "start": 661.087,
      "end": 663.548,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also that they might have a country",
      "verse": "22:34",
      "lineIndex": 182
    },
    {
      "start": 663.728,
      "end": 666.607,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whither they might flee, according to their desires.",
      "verse": "22:34",
      "lineIndex": 183
    },
    {
      "start": 667.287,
      "end": 670.445,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I, after having said this, return again",
      "verse": "22:35",
      "lineIndex": 184
    },
    {
      "start": 670.625,
      "end": 674.572,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to the account of Ammon and Aaron, Omner and Himni,",
      "verse": "22:35",
      "lineIndex": 185
    },
    {
      "start": 674.752,
      "end": 676.099,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their brethren.",
      "verse": "22:35",
      "lineIndex": 186
    }
  ]
}